2. The prose, the house rules and the historical essays — CC BY-SA 4.0
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The written argument — the chapters, the sidenotes, the rulings, the era table,
the historical commentary, and the module's own house rules (everything the page
marks MODULE) — is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International Licence.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

You may share and adapt it, including commercially, provided you give
attribution and license your adaptation under the same terms.


3. What is NOT licensed here
----------------------------

**The ACKS II rules.** This is an unofficial supplement for the *Adventurer
Conqueror King System II*, published by Autarch LLC. Every figure the page marks
RAW — wage tables, garrison requirements, Tribute Inefficiency bands, Call to
Arms, unit costs, Personal Authority, and the page numbers that cite them — is
Autarch's, quoted here for reference and comment. Neither licence above conveys
any right to that material. Autarch is not affiliated with this project and has
not endorsed it.

**Hârn.** Material marked HÂRN refers to the Hârn setting, © N. Robin Crossby
and Columbia Games Inc. It is referenced, not licensed. Kaldor, Chybisa, Melderyn
and the rest are theirs.

**Cited scholarship.** Material marked HISTORY or DEBATED cites published
historical work — Harvey, Hollister, Harriss, Prestwich, Coss, and the record
editions and databases named in the Library. Citations are citations; the works
themselves are their authors' and publishers'.

If you reuse this project, the safe reading is: the code and the house rules are
yours to build on under the terms above; the rules text, the setting and the
scholarship are not, and you will need to reach your own arrangement with their
owners.
